			"notes": "## OnlyCoords v1.1.0\n\nExtended Minecraft version support: this release adds dedicated builds for 1.21.6, 1.21.9, and 1.21.11, bringing total coverage to 9 Minecraft versions.\n\n### Supported Minecraft versions\n- Minecraft 1.21.6 → `onlycoords-1.1.0+1.21.6.jar` (covers 1.21.6, 1.21.7)\n- Minecraft 1.21.8 → `onlycoords-1.1.0+1.21.8.jar`\n- Minecraft 1.21.9 → `onlycoords-1.1.0+1.21.9.jar` (covers 1.21.9, 1.21.10)\n- Minecraft 1.21.11 → `onlycoords-1.1.0+1.21.11.jar`\n- Minecraft 26.1.x → `onlycoords-1.1.0+26.1.2.jar` (covers 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2)\n\nAll builds tested in-game on their respective versions. No behavior changes from v1.0.0, only expanded compatibility.\n\n### Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader for your Minecraft version\n2. Drop Fabric API and the matching OnlyCoords jar in your `mods/` folder\n3. Recommended: add ModMenu + YACL for in-game configuration\n\n### License\nMIT © 2026 Kuzalo"
