			"notes": "## OnlyCoords v1.0.0\n\nFirst public release of **OnlyCoords**, the Fabric mod that shows just your coordinates. Nothing else.\n\n### Supported Minecraft versions\n- Minecraft 1.21.8 → `onlycoords-1.0.0+1.21.8.jar`\n- Minecraft 26.1.2 → `onlycoords-1.0.0+26.1.2.jar`\n\n### Features\n- Configurable HUD: 9 anchor positions, scale, decimal precision, color, shadow, background\n- Optional cardinal direction indicator\n- In-game configuration via ModMenu + YACL\n- JSON persistence\n- Customizable toggle keybinding\n\n### Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader for your Minecraft version\n2. Drop Fabric API and the OnlyCoords jar in your `mods/` folder\n3. Recommended: add ModMenu + YACL for in-game configuration\n\n### License\nMIT © 2026 Kuzalo"
